    "description": "The Education Enrollments Waitlist API provides a functionality for retrieving the current waitlist data for education enrollment programs. This allows institutions and students to check the status and availability of enrollment options and understand waitlist dynamics. Typical consumers of this API include educational administrators, IT systems, and students seeking admission information. By leveraging this API, stakeholders can make informed decisions regarding enrollment processes and resource allocation.",
